<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB lowers 96 net forecast to 1.7 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>PNB lowers 96 net forecast to 1.7 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine National Bank has reduced its forecast for full-year 1996 net income, stripped of extraordinaries, to 1.7 billion pesos from 2.0 billion pesos, senior vice president Liwayway Gener told Reuters.</p>
